sequenceDiagram
  participant F as Feed stream
  participant S as Sorter
  participant R as Closed reactor
  participant A as Analytics
  participant P as Product recovery
  participant Q as Safety supervisor
  F->>S: Captured and dewatered material
  S->>Q: Polymer confidence and reject status
  Q-->>R: Permit only if boundary checks pass
  S->>R: Single-polymer test lot
  R->>A: Effluent and product samples
  A->>Q: Product identity, particles, alarms
  alt all acceptance checks pass
    Q-->>P: Release identified product stream
    P-->>Q: Purity and mass-balance record
  else any unknown product or particle escape
    Q-->>R: Stop and isolate
    R-->>Q: Secured residue and inspection record
  end

